{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Harvest Farm! Here, you'll take on the role of a magical farmer, planting various crops with unique effects to defend against locust swarms and the invasion of the Nian beast. Use your strategy and layout skills to overcome challenges year after year!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936410/extras/2d36ed3ae6fada901cdf060c159ab4bc.avif?t=1758536066\" width=462 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, you'll need to <strong>carefully select your seeds</strong> (pay attention to how different crops complement each other!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936410/extras/7b1728ec3d7d42024fe008a904cd8725.poster.avif?t=1758536066\" width=640 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936410/extras/7b1728ec3d7d42024fe008a904cd8725.webm?t=1758536066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936410/extras/7b1728ec3d7d42024fe008a904cd8725.mp4?t=1758536066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grow plants quickly by sowing and watering them</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936410/extras/fbc26475a3a28fc23c41425a29e9514d.poster.avif?t=1758536066\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936410/extras/fbc26475a3a28fc23c41425a29e9514d.webm?t=1758536066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><